Four embryos, 1, 2, 3 and 4, were tested for the $\text{Hb}^\text{S}$ allele using RFLP analysis. Fig. 3.4 shows the DNA fragments separated by gel electrophoresis for the four embryos. The DNA fragments for two individuals of known genotype, homozygous for $\text{Hb}^\text{A}$ and homozygous for $\text{Hb}^\text{S}$, are also shown.

